# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — meshoptimizer 索引编解码器三角形旋转：消费者往返测试必须按三角形集合等价比较 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-03
# Software: meshoptimizer 1.0
# Gate: conan-verify G2 (test_package) / test_package 消费者测试
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv
#   4. Write knowledge/doc/E0XX.md

id:                     DRAFT-meshoptimizer-1.0-index-codec-triangle-rotation
trigger_tool:           conan|test_package|meshoptimizer|indexcodec|cmake
phase:                  test_package|conan-verify|G2
error_signature:        meshopt_decodeIndexBuffer rc=-3|
                         index codec round-trip mismatch|
                         data != data_safe_end|
                         FAIL: meshopt_decodeIndexBuffer

severity:               2
category:               ohos, conan, testing, codec
match_keywords:         meshoptimizer, indexcodec, getEdgeFifo, rotate, triangle rotation, memcmp, round-trip, triangle-set, decode, encode, 三角形旋转, 集合等价, 消费者测试, test_package
title:                  meshoptimizer 索引编解码器 getEdgeFifo 隐式旋转三角形顶点 → 解码结果三角形集合等价而非字节一致；消费者往返测试必须按排序三角形集合比较（memcmp 会假失败）

root_cause:             |
  meshopt_encodeIndexBuffer 编码时经 getEdgeFifo 按已编码边缘隐式旋转三角形顶点顺序
  （indexcodec.cpp 注释: "getEdgeFifo implicitly rotates triangles by matching a/b to
  existing edge"）。解码输出保证三角形集合与原输入一致，但不保证每个三角形内顶点
  书写顺序与输入相同。因此以 memcmp/逐字节比较做"无损往返"验证会命中假失败：
  本次立方体 36 索引中有 6 个索引（2 个三角形）被轮换。上游 roundtripIndexTricky 等
  用例数据恰好不触发旋转路径，其 memcmp 断言成立，容易让人误以为解码结果恒字节一致。
  另注意 decode 的 buffer_size 参数必须传实际编码长度（encode 返回值），不能传 bound
  大小（含尾随零会导致 data != data_safe_end → rc=-3）。

affected_scope:         任何以 meshoptimizer 索引编解码器做无损往返验证的消费者库/测试；
                         含 Conan test_package 与下游集成测试
verification_cmd:       clang++ -std=c++17 -I src test.cpp build-ci/libmeshoptimizer.a -o t && ./t
rec_priority:           1

prescan_pattern:        memcmp\(decoded|meshopt_decodeIndexBuffer\(
